{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Propagate JVM-fatal hook failures without waiting behind arbitrary cleanup.** After catching `VirtualMachineError` or `ThreadDeath`, the loop still invokes every remaining end hook. If one blocks, the fatal never reaches the invocation caller. Rethrow JVM-fatal failures immediately, or make subsequent best-effort cleanup bounded.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77qqSg","finding_digest":"c92b7c1747a290739ec238dd4ec3ebca21a44760e63e5f5597374768eeaf7d5f","finding_id":"arf_v1_zevxyf2hukihhhwchdou5q7lzi","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::finalizeafterhandlerscopes::scope-fatal-observation-liveness","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::finalizeafterhandlerscopes::scope-fatal-observation-liveness","line":113,"observation_digest":"57711b4b5c5c11b3dc5c889e9b4a18e20400e01d246c19de6e15fb902c82b0da","observation_id":"aro_v1_k5yrws24lqi3hxc4rcpjwsqy4i","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_zevxyf2hukihhhwchdou5q7lzi","published_at":"2026-10-08T17:41:44Z","review_id":"arr_v1_w4f4vfmlkvk6yuwzqbo6rmxwrf","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"6c590162ee0e40cbba600285b7fafbadc0457c8e","reviewer":"codex","start_line":113,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_iq7nrujhgrenbpsf7k4ac5z3w3","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T17:41:44Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
